      "subject": "fix(knowledge): capsule inspector shows validated layers, and Knowledge Operations types (MS-2026-0006)",
      "body": "The capsule inspector tested layer status against validated, but layers are healthy, warning or failed: validation always read partial, every layer counted as an exception, and every layer showed rose. Healthy now counts as validated. Type fixes with no visual change: props the components never used (emphasis on panels, columns on metric grids, as={undefined} on surfaces) and dead appearance references are removed; panels without a title pass title={null}; empty starting summaries carry their newer fields; the tab setter is checked; KnowledgeCapsuleModel is aliased to KnowledgeCapsule; ExecutivePremiumIcon accepts Knowledge Operations' SVG icons; the ribbon imports its metric type; an always-false conversation filter check is removed. Knowledge Operations contract re-certified after owner visual approval: seven files are pixel-identical, the capsule inspector changes as described. Live code typechecks; 15 errors remain in tests and two never-loaded v1 files.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0006\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
